db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-16191" :question/id #uuid "b83a4a66-e8e0-551c-a454-22f750efc6ee" :question/math-academy-id "q-16191" :question/problem "Determine the graph of the following parametrically defined curve:\n\n$$\nx={t}^{2},\\,\\,\\,y=t(5-t),\\,0\\le t\\le 5\n$$" :question/worked-solution "We need to create a table of values and then sketch the curve. First, we work out the $x$-values using the formula $x={t}^{2}.$ This gives\n\n| **$t$** | $0$ | $1$ | $2$ | $3$ | $4$ | $5$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $x$ | $0$ | $1$ | $4$ | $9$ | $16$ | $25$ |\n| $y$ | $$ | $$ | $$ | $$ | $$ | $$ |\n\n$$\n\n$$\n\nNow, we work out the $y$ values using $y=t(5-t).$ This gives\n\n| **$t$** | $0$ | $1$ | $2$ | $3$ | $4$ | $5$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $x$ | $0$ | $1$ | $4$ | $9$ | $16$ | $25$ |\n| $y$ | $0$ | $4$ | $6$ | $6$ | $4$ | $0$ |\n\n$$\n\n$$\n\nPlotting these points, we obtain the following curve:\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13949104/assets/1aa848f287660c0858d5d6478da71c5baab9252c13f0a2d4a48c38d61f6bce51.png)" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-16191/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "e0dc11d5-8eda-52b1-b7b1-42b481813ff4"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-16191"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-326271/field-1/b785f042bcb1e3ac9f1c15e72aea8c54b522212617bb84e48c5ba505bb17b3ea" :answer/id #uuid "03d2e027-12bc-5336-8af7-7f10422196b2" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\ge" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-326271/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "81861ba9-0c02-5338-a6b1-ac4cd73882ed" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-326271/field-1/b785f042bcb1e3ac9f1c15e72aea8c54b522212617bb84e48c5ba505bb17b3ea" :answer-field/choices ["q-326271/field-1/b785f042bcb1e3ac9f1c15e72aea8c54b5222126